            "review_text": "Tho D\nHanoi, Vietnam100 contributions\n0\nWorst creme brulee in my life\nJul 2017 • Friends\nThis place seems nice from the outside but we were disappointed with both the service and food quality. I saw creme brulee in the display cabinet but when I asked for it, the staff didn't even know what creme brulee is. When they finally figured out, I was served a ramekin of custard exactly like how they displayed in the cabinet, which means no melted sugar on top. Seriously, who has creme brulee without that crispy sugar top??? Fortunately they understood what I said and brought me another ramekin that looked like creme brulee. But the taste was so bad I could feel nothing but sugar in the custard. The texture was aslo thicker than normal. Drinks were too much sugar, too. Totally disappointed!\nAbout the music, there was live music but only the pianist was okay. Other members in the band and the singers suck.\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
