            "review_title": "Review at Jazz & Bar",
            "review_text": "Sally r\nLeicester, United Kingdom108 contributions\n0\nUsed just for breakfast\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nWe were staying at the hotel up from the Jazz which had a very poor breakfast so we used the Jazz every morning and paid 100,000 dong per person (about 4 pounds) - we also would call in here for a night cap as it was the only place open on that strip - it isn't the cheapest and they do take full advantage of the tourist trap and a captive audience. But = it s a business and the staff are great and the food is tasty and the place very clean.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 11, 2017",
