            "review_text": "Lee Ann B\nCaracas, Venezuela45 contributions\n0\namazing view, amazing food\nJan 2016 • Couples\nWhile riding bikes along the sea we stopped at Jazz Café for lunch. The breeze blew off the water and we enjoyed a delicious lunch of seafood soup, coconut juice and shrimp.Fantastic. The owner invited us back that evening for live Jazz music, it was amazing. Great café, wonderful ambiance and they valet park your bikes.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 28, 2016",
